title: "Beyond Refusal: Prompt-Conditioned Task Selection in LLM Safety"
abstract: >
  Evaluation pipeline for measuring how eight system-prompt families at three
  clarity levels route fixed HarmBench, XSTest, and IHEval items among six
  behavioral policies across four instruction-tuned language models.
